### 1. Unversioned path returns 404
GET http://localhost:3000/api/restaurants

### 2. Versioned restaurants list returns 200 with Page<Restaurant>
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/restaurants

### 3. Create restaurant -> 201 Created with Location header
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Habesha Kitfo House",
  "area": "Bole",
  "cuisine": "Traditional"
}

### 4. Orders list with descending sort (?sort=-totalSantim)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?sort=-totalSantim

### 5. Orders list with sparse fieldsets (?fields= shrinks payload)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?fields=id,totalSantim

### 6. Multi-value comma-separated status filter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?status=PENDING,PREPARING

### 7. Limit cap validation (?limit=999 -> 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?limit=999

### 8. Nested orders for existing restaurant (id=1 -> 200 Page<Order>)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/restaurants/1/orders

### 9. Create order -> 201 Created with Location header
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "customerName": "Abebe Bikila",
  "area": "Bole",
  "totalSantim": 125000
}

### 10. Update order status -> 200 OK
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "OUT_FOR_DELIVERY"
}

### 11. DELETE order first time -> 204 No Content (empty body)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/14

### 12. DELETE same order second time -> 204 No Content (idempotent)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/14